      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِعْدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A tremour, quivering, quaking, shivering,</i>
or <i>commotion,</i> (S, A, L, Msb, K,) occasioned by
fear, (A, L,) or cold, (A,) &amp;c; (L;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَعْدَةٌ</span></b> 
signifies the same. (K.)

